@* THROWAWAY PROTOTYPE - stands in for lucide-react, which ai-hub uses and
   Blazor can't. Inline Lucide (ISC) path data, same 24x24 / stroke-2 /
   round-cap geometry, so the icons read identically to ai-hub's. If a variant
   wins, decide properly whether to take a dependency or keep inlining.
   Delete with Components/Prototype/. *@

<svg class="hub-icon @Class"
     width="@Size" height="@Size"
     viewBox="0 0 24 24"
     fill="none"
     stroke="currentColor"
     stroke-width="2"
     stroke-linecap="round"
     stroke-linejoin="round"
     aria-hidden="true"
     focusable="false">@Paths</svg>

